<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major></Major>
    <Description>this nmacri will quicly drop ALL items (30 seconds for 220 items) from the currently selected page of your backpack inventory,

Usage:
1. Pull up your inventory, then select your desired inventory category (ex. Ingredients, Weopons, Traps, etc.) 
2. Run the macro
3.  Enjoy the amazement and wonder other players exhibit when they see you turbo drop items.</Description>
    <Comment>https://keyran.net - Free macros download | Скачать бесплатные макросы </Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>0</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
    <KeyUp>
      <Syntax></Syntax>
    </KeyUp>
    <KeyDown>
      <Syntax>MoveTo 1049 359
Delay 20 ms
MoveTo 535 362
KeyDown 27 1
KeyUp 27 1
MoveTo 1213 595
Delay 20 ms
LeftDown 1
Delay 40 ms
LeftUp 1
MoveTo 795 669
Delay 20 ms
LeftDown 1
Delay 40 ms
LeftUp 1
GoWhile 2 50</Syntax>
    </KeyDown>
    <Software>Fortnite</Software>
  </DefaultMacro>
</Root>